WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.402
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.603
We hope you're doing well
tonight,

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:05.071
and now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.373
President Biden tonight
delivered his first

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:08.574
State of the Union address,

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:11.744
and thank God he got that
Supreme Court Justice in,

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:15.181
'cause there was not much else
to talk about.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:18.785
Uh, I think there's a new
"Batman" movie this week.

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.320
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.322
"The New York Times"
published a report yesterday

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:24.523
that US officials
are currently debating

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:27.193
Russian President Vladimir
Putin's grip on reality.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:30.930
In related news, Putin just
ordered troops into Hogwarts.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.132
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:35.668
When asked by a reporter
at a Black History Month event

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.337
yesterday if Americans should be
worried about nuclear war,

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:39.972
President Biden said no.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:40.906
Yeah, come on.

00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:42.175
Putin isn't gonna bomb

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.477
the only people
still supporting him.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.712
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.914
That's right, President Biden
was asked if Americans

00:00:48.914 --> 00:00:51.383
should be worried about
nuclear war, and he said no.

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:55.221
But then the CDC said yes,
and the FDA said,

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.357
"We'll let you know
in four to six weeks,"

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:59.725
so I don't know
what's gonna happen.

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:02.762
Officials in Ukraine last week
asked Apple CEO Tim Cook

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:05.098
to ban Russia from using
the company's products

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:08.067
and services in response
to their attack on Ukraine.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:11.604
Well, if being the only country
whose messages in the group chat

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:15.007
are green doesn't
force Russia to surrender,

00:01:15.007 --> 00:01:16.843
I don't know what will.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:19.679
[ Russian accent ]
This is embarrassment.

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:20.914
We are only green.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.183
No one even read these texts.

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:28.187
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:29.989
[ Normal voice ]
The Senate last night failed

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.124
to pass the Women's Health
Protection Act,

00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:34.961
and West Virginia Senator Joe
Manchin voted with Republicans.

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:37.463
Okay, how many times does
someone have to vote

00:01:37.463 --> 00:01:39.966
with Republicans before
you consider him a Republican?

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.134
It's kind of like saying
Keith Richards played

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:43.402
with the Rolling Stones again.

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:46.939
Yeah,
'cause he's a Rolling Stone.

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:49.509
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi told
reporters yesterday

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:52.010
that Congress will support
"whatever it is"

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:54.613
the Ukraine needs amid Russia's
invasion of the country.

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:56.715
Well, unless
it's universal healthcare...

00:01:58.083 --> 00:02:01.253
in which case there's all --
there's a co-pay, it's a mess.

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:02.855
New Orleans held its first

00:02:02.855 --> 00:02:04.757
full-scale
Mardi Gras celebration today

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:07.560
since 2020 when
the coronavirus pandemic hit

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.363
but required masks
in indoor public spaces.

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:12.432
Still, men were throwing beads

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:14.400
and yelling,
"Show us your chin!"

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.607
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:23.175
Today was National Pig Day.

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:25.645
[ Cheers and applause ]
"When isn't it" asked an --

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.246
What is wrong with you?

00:02:27.246 --> 00:02:29.648
[ Laughter ]
Why are you cheering for it

00:02:29.648 --> 00:02:31.584
like you even knew
it was a thing?

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.989
I don't understand
that reaction.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.323
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:39.158
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:39.158 --> 00:02:41.394
If you cared so much,
why didn't you know?

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:46.632
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:46.632 --> 00:02:48.368
I'm gonna tell the joke now,
alright?

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:52.638
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:52.638 --> 00:02:55.341
I told you there should be
a National Pig Day!

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:58.244
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.244 --> 00:02:59.946
Today was National Pig Day.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.949
"When isn't it?"
asked an exhausted Charlotte.

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:05.218
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:08.121
"This friendship is starting
to feel very one-sided."

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.459
It lost its momentum
a little bit

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:16.495
when everybody
lost their [bleep] minds

00:03:16.495 --> 00:03:17.930
about National Pig Day.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.533
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:21.968
You know what else?

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.636
I bet someone here
had bacon this morning.

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:24.737
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.906
On National Pig Day.

00:03:28.607 --> 00:03:30.343
[ Chuckles ] You monsters.

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:34.280
In honor of St. Patrick's Day,
Dunkin' Donuts

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.215
is offering
a shamrock macchiato.

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:39.252
In a related story, Italy
has declared war on Ireland.

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:40.853
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:43.122
That's right.

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:44.356
Dunkin' Donuts is offering

00:03:44.356 --> 00:03:45.758
a shamrock macchiato,

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.561
which is green
and features Irish cream flavor.

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:51.197
So, look for that
on a sidewalk near you.

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.265
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:54.601
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

